#: StructureDefinition.element.LogCarePathwayCz.carePathway.centrumSoucastiErn/definition
msgid "Yes / No / Unknown / Not Asked. Při kladné odpovědi je vyžadován alespoň jeden název ERN v položce 9.8."
msgstr "Data element acting as a flag to indicate whether the treating centre is formally affiliated with a European Reference Network (ERN).\n\nThis data element is Not Mandatory\n\nThe recommended data standard is Value Set: Yes No Unknown Not Asked\nhttps://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/ValueSet-yes-no-unknown-not-asked.html"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
